{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn up the volume and set off on a rhythmic adventure that blends precision platforming with infectious beats in more than 30 energizing levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784780/extras/ed0aa20de6b27afc381e9df7f2b3607b.poster.avif?t=1772811523\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784780/extras/ed0aa20de6b27afc381e9df7f2b3607b.webm?t=1772811523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784780/extras/ed0aa20de6b27afc381e9df7f2b3607b.mp4?t=1772811523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of hopping, bopping, sliding, and slamming your way around a selection of hazards that activate in sync to the music. Race against time to set a new high-score or try to hunt down tapes for your collection to unlock new stages and costumes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784780/extras/91d9b3b5dbbced6463d9955a4cd9f6b8.avif?t=1772811523\" width=616 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See if you can find the secret areas, each offering unique unlockables and bonus collectibles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784780/extras/3cbf00a30039cb7044d1994f9d19a0f1.avif?t=1772811523\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re ready, then start Hop\u2019n &amp; Bop\u2019n!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/i